{
  "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang",
  "chapter": 1,
  "act": 1,
  "scene": "zhaoyang",
  "palette": "gold",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "shenheng",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "require": {
    "flag.petition_sent": true
  },
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "补件不能抹去原牒，首次核问已经沿细节指向阿荻",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "出了那道门，你赶向昭阳殿送补件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l2",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你跑上石阶，鞋里都是水，袖子贴着仍在发酸的手臂。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l3",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原牒要补一句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l4",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "例证没经当事人允可，后抄的别漏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原件已入署，补件赶上后抄的这份了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "赶上了……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "能添上，不能抽走原件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "阿荻知道写了多少？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只念了例证，宋才人陪她，我先来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "把副本带回去，一条一条说给她听，别只说追过了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一条条说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_chase_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她还没问完，都在那里等着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你跨过积水，袖中留着阿荻要你照录的两句话，没有替她润色。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她听完了，准我补两句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "哪两句？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "旧衣是她送的，私话没许我作呈文。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "照补，原牒却已另抄出去一份了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一份……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "更正还得再走一程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她还说什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "后面的话，等她自己讲。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只带来她准的两句，别替她补满。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.petition_explain_first": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "就这两句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l27",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "昭阳殿檐口还在滴雨，缺耳尖的马等着回厩，鼻息吹动湿鬃。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l28",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "它听见空桶挪动，又偏了一下头；没有因为那日停过试就不再怕响。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l29",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你下意识想去碰它，唐简手中的回牒却已经展开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l30",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "回来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l31",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "回牒？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l32",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "叫我何时来？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l33",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没先叫你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l34",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l35",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "沈衡移开挡光的手。那一行字完整地露出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l36",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "初八西库旧衣十一件，先问交纳经手人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l37",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "提出人是我，先叫我——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l38",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "经手人是她。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l39",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l40",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "日期、库名、件数，已足够找过去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l41",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你按住冰冷的湿袖口，那里还留着阿荻替你改的针脚。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l42",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我没问她就引了私话，也记下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l43",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这件……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l44",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "别等她开口，又只剩那行旧欠。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l45",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "已记，送递先后也留着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l46",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她在补件旁添下时刻，另取一份，不去抹原牒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l47",
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "传问已往掖庭去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l48",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l49",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "马蹄在阶下挪了一步，你却望向来时那道门。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s18_zhaoyang.l50",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你收起副本，转身往掖庭去。"
    }
  ],
  "chapterEnd": true,
  "goto": "ch02_s01_yeting"
}
